---
import HomeLayout from '../../../layouts/HomeLayout.astro';
import PageIntro from '../../../components/PageIntro.astro';
import EditorialQuote from '../../../components/EditorialQuote.astro';
import StrategicMatrix from '../../../components/StrategicMatrix.astro';
import { strategyIllusion } from '../../../data/strategicMatrices';
import mikeTyson from '../../../assets/editorial/mike-tyson2.png';
---
<HomeLayout title="The Strategy Illusion — Strategic Decision Maps | The Spotted Ape" description="One café, four possible situations. A story about clear choices, consistent action and the trap of confusing a busy team with a strategy." schemaType="Article">
<PageIntro eyebrow="Thinking / Strategic decision map" scale="long">
<Fragment slot="heading">{strategyIllusion.question}</Fragment>
<nav class="page-nav" aria-label="Article navigation">
<a href="/thinking/">← All thinking</a>
<a href="#strategy-illusion-map">View the quadrant map ↓</a>
</nav>
</PageIntro>
<article class="decision-map">
<div class="wrap quote-spread">
<EditorialQuote quote="Everybody has a plan until they get punched in the mouth." attribution="Mike Tyson" portrait={mikeTyson} portraitAlt="Black-and-white editorial portrait of Mike Tyson with his distinctive facial tattoo." />
</div>
<div class="map-reading wrap">
<div class="prose">
<p>A fictional café expands its menu and opening hours. Everyone is busy. Who is it for, and why choose it?</p>
<p>A plan organises work. A strategy chooses who to serve, what to offer and what to leave out.</p>
<h2>Let’s map two questions.</h2>
<dl class="axis-definitions">
<div>
<dt>Across: are the decisions clear?</dt>
<dd>The team knows its customers, why they choose it and what it will refuse.</dd>
</div>
<div>
<dt>Upwards: does the team follow through?</dt>
<dd>People know their responsibilities and deliver what they promise.</dd>
</div>
</dl>
</div>
</div>
<section class="map-figure section-y theme-grey" id="strategy-illusion-map" aria-label="The Strategy Illusion quadrant map">
<div class="wrap">
<div class="section-top meta">
<p>The decision map</p>
<p>Clarity of choice × Consistency of action</p>
</div>
<div class="map-figure-inner">
<StrategicMatrix matrix={strategyIllusion} />
</div>
</div>
</section>
<div class="map-reading wrap">    <section class="map-story" aria-labelledby="story-heading">
      <h2 id="story-heading">One café. Four possible situations.</h2>
      <dl>
        <div>
          <dt>Bottom left — {strategyIllusion.quadrants.bottomLeft.title}</dt>
          <dd class="map-copy">Commuters, long lunches, evening diners: the café serves everyone. Priorities shift and orders arrive late.</dd>
        </div>
        <div>
          <dt>Top left — {strategyIllusion.quadrants.topLeft.title}</dt>
          <dd class="map-copy">Orders arrive on time, but the broad offer remains. The owner cannot explain why customers should choose this café.</dd>
        </div>
        <div>
          <dt>Bottom right — {strategyIllusion.quadrants.bottomRight.title}</dt>
          <dd class="map-copy">The owner chooses quick weekday breakfasts for office workers and drops evening service. Slow preparation still leaves customers waiting.</dd>
        </div>
        <div>
          <dt>Top right — {strategyIllusion.quadrants.topRight.title}</dt>
          <dd class="map-copy">The breakfast choice shapes the menu, staffing and preparation. Customers are served on time. The owner must still test demand and profitability.</dd>
        </div>
      </dl>
      <p class="map-copy" id={`${strategyIllusion.id}-note`}>The Efficient Treadmill: delivering a plan well without examining whether its choices make sense.</p>
    </section>

</div>
<div class="map-ending wrap">
<h2>What needs attention<br />in your team?</h2>
<a class="text-link" href="mailto:hello@thespottedape.com">Let’s talk <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
</a>
</div>
</article>
</HomeLayout>
<style>
.quote-spread {
  border-block: 1px solid var(--line);
}
.quote-spread :global(.editorial-opening) {
  max-width: 1200px;
  margin-inline: auto;
  padding-block: 24px;
}
.quote-spread :global(blockquote p) {
  font-size: var(--heading-2);
  line-height: 1;
  max-width: 18ch;
}
.map-reading {
  padding-block: var(--space-lg);
  max-width: 850px;
}
.axis-definitions {
  margin-top: 40px;
}
.axis-definitions > div + div {
  margin-top: 32px;
}
.axis-definitions dt {
  font-weight: 600;
  font-size: 28px;
  letter-spacing: -0.035em;
  line-height: 1.2;
}
.axis-definitions dd {
  font-size: 22px;
  line-height: 1.5;
  margin: 16px 0 0;
  color: #626262;
}
.map-figure-inner {
  max-width: 1000px;
  margin-inline: auto;
}
.map-figure-inner :global(.matrix-chart) {
  width: 100%;
}
.map-story h2 {
  font-size: var(--heading-2);
  line-height: 1;
  max-width: 15ch;
  margin-bottom: 48px;
}
.map-story dl > div {
  border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
  padding-block: 32px;
}
.map-story dt {
  font-size: 28px;
  line-height: 1.1;
  letter-spacing: -0.035em;
  font-weight: 600;
}
.map-story dd {
  font-size: 22px;
  line-height: 1.5;
  color: #626262;
  margin: 20px 0 0;
  max-width: 62ch;
}
.map-story > p {
  font-size: 22px;
  line-height: 1.5;
  margin-top: 32px;
  border-left: 5px solid var(--signal);
  padding-left: 24px;
}
.map-ending {
  padding-bottom: var(--space-lg);
}
.map-ending h2 {
  font-size: var(--heading-1);
  max-width: 19ch;
  line-height: 1;
}
.map-ending .text-link {
  margin-top: 32px;
}
@media (max-width: 767px) {
  .quote-spread :global(blockquote p) {
    font-size: 40px;
  }
  .map-reading {
    padding-block: 64px;
  }
  .axis-definitions dt,
  .map-story dt {
    font-size: 24px;
  }
  .axis-definitions dd,
  .map-story dd,
  .map-story > p {
    font-size: 20px;
  }
  .map-story h2 {
    font-size: 44px;
  }
  .map-ending h2 {
    font-size: 48px;
  }
  .map-ending {
    padding-bottom: 64px;
  }
}
</style>
